        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "How to get it: SPARQL 1.1 at https://qlever.dev/api/gbif (UI at qlever.dev/gbif). Contains 3 657 852 005 dwc:Occurrence and 7 746 724 dwc:Taxon nodes (2026-10-06); occurrence to taxon via dwciri:toTaxon, hierarchy via skos:broader, coordinates as wdt:P625 WKT. Federates fast with Wikidata and UniProt on the same QLever instance. Load date not published, so treat as a recent copy rather than a fixed snapshot."
      }
